    {id:"angle-a-adjacent-hyp",title:"붙어 있는 변 중 빗변",description:"A에 붙은 두 변 중, 빗변은 어느 것일까요?",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-21",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"angle-a-adjacent-hyp",type:"multiple-choice",question:"A에 붙어 있는 두 변(AB, AC) 중, 빗변은 어느 것인가요?",choices:["AB","AC"],correctAnswer:"AB",explanation:"직각 C와 마주 보는 AB가 빗변이에요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-38.3 -95.6 153.1 125.2\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"직각삼각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M0,0 L80,-60 L80,0 Z\"/><path class=\"d-line\" d=\"M66,0 L66,-14 L80,-14\"/><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M16,-12 A20,20 0 0,1 20,0\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"-18.7\" y=\"7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"91.1\" y=\"-76.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"96\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text></svg>"},review:{summary:"A에 붙은 두 변 중, 직각과 마주 보는 쪽이 빗변이에요.",example:"AB, AC 중 직각 C의 반대편은 AB예요.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-review-22",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"angle-a-adjacent-hyp",type:"multiple-choice",question:"A에 붙어 있는 두 변(AB, AC) 중, 빗변은 어느 것인가요?",choices:["AB","AC"],correctAnswer:"AB",explanation:"직각과 마주 보는 AB가 빗변이에요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-3.2 -138 117.1 227.5\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"직각삼각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M83.3,-100 L20.8,50 L20.8,-100 Z\"/><path class=\"d-line\" d=\"M34.8,-100 L34.8,-86 L20.8,-86\"/><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M75.6,-81.5 A20,20 0 0,1 63.3,-100\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"96.1\" y=\"-115.4\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"16.7\" y=\"69.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"13.1\" y=\"-118.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text></svg>"}}},
    {id:"angle-a-adjacent-base",title:"빗변이 아닌 인접변(밑변)",description:"A에 붙어 있지만 빗변이 아닌 변을 찾아요.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-23",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"angle-a-adjacent-base",type:"multiple-choice",question:"A에 붙어 있지만 빗변이 아닌 변은 어느 것인가요?",choices:["AB","AC","BC"],correctAnswer:"AC",explanation:"AB는 빗변이니, A에 붙은 나머지 변 AC가 답이에요. 이 변을 밑변(인접변)이라고 불러요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-38.3 -95.6 153.1 125.2\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"직각삼각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M0,0 L80,-60 L80,0 Z\"/><path class=\"d-line\" d=\"M66,0 L66,-14 L80,-14\"/><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M16,-12 A20,20 0 0,1 20,0\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"-18.7\" y=\"7\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"91.1\" y=\"-76.6\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"96\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text></svg>"},review:{summary:"A에 붙은 두 변 중 빗변이 아닌 쪽 = 밑변(인접변).",example:"AB(빗변)를 빼고 남은, A에 붙은 변이 밑변이에요.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-review-24",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"angle-a-adjacent-base",type:"multiple-choice",question:"A에 붙어 있지만 빗변이 아닌 변은 어느 것인가요?",choices:["AB","AC","BC"],correctAnswer:"AC",explanation:"빗변 AB를 제외한, A에 붙은 변 AC가 밑변이에요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-85.8 -102.9 226.1 139.2\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"직각삼각형\"><path class=\"d-shape\" d=\"M103.3,3.3 L-46.7,-76.7 L103.3,-76.7 Z\"/><path class=\"d-line\" d=\"M103.3,-62.7 L89.3,-62.7 L89.3,-76.7\"/><path class=\"d-arc\" d=\"M85.7,-6.1 A20,20 0 0,1 103.3,-16.7\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"117\" y=\"17.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">A</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"-66\" y=\"-81.9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">B</text><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"120.9\" y=\"-86.1\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">C</text></svg>"}}},
    {id:"ratio-basics-1",title:"두 길이 비교하기 1",description:"두 길이를 비교해 분수로 나타내는 연습이에요.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-25",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"ratio-basics",type:"multiple-choice",question:"위 막대 길이는 아래 막대 길이의 얼마일까요? (위:아래 = 분수로)",choices:["3/5","5/3","3/8","5/8"],correctAnswer:"3/5",explanation:"위 3, 아래 5이므로 3/5예요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 100 72\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"길이 비 3대5\"><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"48\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"24\" y=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">3</text><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"80\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"40\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text></svg>"},review:{summary:"위 길이 ÷ 아래 길이를 분수로 나타내면 돼요.",example:"위 2, 아래 7이면 2/7.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-review-26",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"ratio-basics",type:"multiple-choice",question:"위 막대 길이는 아래 막대 길이의 얼마일까요?",choices:["2/7","7/2","2/9","7/9"],correctAnswer:"2/7",explanation:"위 2, 아래 7이므로 2/7이에요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 132 72\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"길이 비 2대7\"><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"32\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"16\" y=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">2</text><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"56\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text></svg>"}}},
    {id:"ratio-basics-2",title:"두 길이 비교하기 2",description:"숫자를 바꿔 한 번 더 연습해요.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-27",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"ratio-basics",type:"multiple-choice",question:"위 막대 길이는 아래 막대 길이의 얼마일까요?",choices:["4/9","9/4","4/13","9/13"],correctAnswer:"4/9",explanation:"위 4, 아래 9이므로 4/9예요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 140 72\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"길이 비 4대9\"><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"53.3\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"26.65\" y=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">4</text><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"60\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">9</text></svg>"},review:{summary:"분수의 위(분자)가 위 막대, 아래(분모)가 아래 막대예요.",example:"위 5, 아래 8이면 5/8.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-review-28",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"ratio-basics",type:"multiple-choice",question:"위 막대 길이는 아래 막대 길이의 얼마일까요?",choices:["5/8","8/5","5/13","8/13"],correctAnswer:"5/8",explanation:"위 5, 아래 8이므로 5/8이에요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 140 72\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"길이 비 5대8\"><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"37.5\" y=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">5</text><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"60\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">8</text></svg>"}}},
    {id:"ratio-basics-3",title:"두 길이 비교하기 3",description:"조금 더 큰 숫자로 연습해요.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-29",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"ratio-basics",type:"multiple-choice",question:"위 막대 길이는 아래 막대 길이의 얼마일까요?",choices:["6/11","11/6","6/17","11/17"],correctAnswer:"6/11",explanation:"위 6, 아래 11이므로 6/11이에요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 140 72\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"길이 비 6대11\"><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"65.5\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"32.75\" y=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">6</text><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"60\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">11</text></svg>"},review:{summary:"항상 (위 길이)/(아래 길이) 순서로 분수를 만들어요.",example:"위 7, 아래 12이면 7/12.",question:{id:"m3-trig-v3-pre-review-30",grade:"middle3",unit:"trigonometric-ratios",conceptId:"ratio-basics",type:"multiple-choice",question:"위 막대 길이는 아래 막대 길이의 얼마일까요?",choices:["7/12","12/7","7/19","12/19"],correctAnswer:"7/12",explanation:"위 7, 아래 12이므로 7/12예요.",diagram:"<svg viewBox=\"-10 -10 140 72\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"길이 비 7대12\"><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"35\" y=\"9\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">7</text><rect class=\"d-shape\" x=\"0\" y=\"34\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\"/><text class=\"d-label\" x=\"60\" y=\"43\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">12</text></svg>"}}}
